    <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Careers — Operator Side</div>
    <h1>What Does a <span>Company Man</span> Do?</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">The operator's representative on location, with final say over the well program. A genuinely different career track from the drilling-contractor supervisory roles it's constantly confused with.</p>
    <div class="page-meta">
      <span class="page-meta-item">Pay: <strong>$150K–$300K+/yr</strong></span>
      <span class="page-meta-item">Timeline: <strong>15+ years, often via engineering</strong></span>
      <span class="page-meta-item">Employer: <strong>The Operator, Not the Contractor</strong></span>
    </div>
